 "note": "gain reaches the source's output stage, bufferDuration is bufferLength / sampleRate (sampleRate held to 3000..768000, -1 with no samples) and stays 0 while load is TRUE, and a started one-shot ends by itself when its samples run out (2 s here), as in X_ITE 16.6.0. Runs on the real clock. The buffer is silence (no samples given) so nothing audible is compared.",
